{"seq":1,"slug":"threads-and-channels","title":"线程与消息传递","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/concurrency/threads-and-channels","wordCount":724,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"线程与消息传递\">线程与消息传递</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rust 的并发安全不是靠运行时检查，而是靠<strong>类型标记</strong>：<code>Send</code> 表示类型的所有权可安全转移给另一线程，<code>Sync</code> 表示类型可被多线程共享引用。编译器在编译期检查这些约束，把数据竞争排除在编译错误之外——这是&quot;无畏并发&quot;（Fearless Concurrency）的真正含义。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>Send</code>/<code>Sync</code> 是自动推导的</strong>：<code>Rc&lt;T&gt;</code> 因引用计数非原子而不满足 <code>Send</code>，<code>RefCell&lt;T&gt;</code> 因运行时借用检查不满足 <code>Sync</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>线程闭包要求 <code>Send + &#39;static</code></strong>：跨线程的执行体不能借用栈上数据，因此需要 <code>move</code> 转移所有权。</li>\n<li><strong>通道优于共享内存</strong>：消息传递让所有权随消息一起转移，天然避免了共享可变状态的大部分问题。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"创建线程\">创建线程</h2><p>Rust 通过 <code>std::thread::spawn</code> 创建操作系统线程，闭包必须满足 <code>Send + &#39;static</code> 约束。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::thread;&#10;use std::time::Duration;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let handle = thread::spawn(|| {&#10;        for i in 1..=5 {&#10;            println!(&quot;子线程: {}&quot;, i);&#10;            thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(100));&#10;        }&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    for i in 1..=3 {&#10;        println!(&quot;主线程: {}&quot;, i);&#10;        thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(150));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    handle.join().unwrap();&#10;    println!(&quot;所有线程完成&quot;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::thread;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::time::Duration;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let handle = thread::spawn(|| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for i in 1..=5 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"子线程: {}\", i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(100));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 1..=3 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"主线程: {}\", i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(150));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    handle.join().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"所有线程完成\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"move-闭包与所有权转移\">move 闭包与所有权转移</h2><p>跨线程传递数据时，必须使用 <code>move</code> 将所有权转移给线程闭包。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::thread;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let data = vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5];&#10;&#10;    let handle = thread::spawn(move || {&#10;        let sum: i32 = data.iter().sum();&#10;        println!(&quot;子线程计算和: {}&quot;, sum);&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    // println!(&quot;{:?}&quot;, data); // 编译错误：data 已被移动&#10;    handle.join().unwrap();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::thread;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let data = vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let handle = thread::spawn(move || {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let sum: i32 = data.iter().sum();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"子线程计算和: {}\", sum);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // println!(\"{:?}\", data); // 编译错误：data 已被移动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    handle.join().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"send-与-sync-trait\">Send 与 Sync Trait</h2><p><code>Send</code> 和 <code>Sync</code> 是 Rust 并发安全的类型级保证，由编译器自动推导。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Trait</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型实现</th>\n<th>典型不实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Send</code></td>\n<td>类型可跨线程转移所有权</td>\n<td><code>String</code>, <code>Vec&lt;T&gt;</code>, <code>Arc&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Rc&lt;T&gt;</code>, 裸指针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Sync</code></td>\n<td>类型可被多线程共享引用</td>\n<td><code>i32</code>, <code>Arc&lt;T&gt;</code>, <code>Mutex&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Cell&lt;T&gt;</code>, <code>RefCell&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code>T: Send</code> 表示 <code>T</code> 的所有权可安全转移到另一个线程；<code>T: Sync</code> 等价于 <code>&amp;T: Send</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"mpsc-通道\">mpsc 通道</h2><p><code>std::sync::mpsc</code>（Multiple Producer, Single Consumer）提供线程间的消息传递机制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::sync::mpsc;&#10;use std::thread;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let (tx, rx) = mpsc::channel();&#10;&#10;    thread::spawn(move || {&#10;        let messages = vec![&quot;你好&quot;, &quot;来自&quot;, &quot;子线程&quot;];&#10;        for msg in messages {&#10;            tx.send(msg).unwrap();&#10;            thread::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(200));&#10;        }&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    for received in rx {&#10;        println!(&quot;收到: {}&quot;, received);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::mpsc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::thread;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let (tx, rx) = mpsc::channel();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    thread::spawn(move || {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let messages = vec![\"你好\", \"来自\", \"子线程\"];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for msg in messages {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            tx.send(msg).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            thread::sleep(std::time::Duration::from_millis(200));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for received in rx {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"收到: {}\", received);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"多生产者\">多生产者</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::sync::mpsc;&#10;use std::thread;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let (tx, rx) = mpsc::channel();&#10;&#10;    for i in 0..3 {&#10;        let tx_clone = tx.clone();&#10;        thread::spawn(move || {&#10;            tx_clone.send(format!(&quot;线程 {} 的消息&quot;, i)).unwrap();&#10;        });&#10;    }&#10;    drop(tx);&#10;&#10;    for msg in rx {&#10;        println!(&quot;收到: {}&quot;, msg);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::mpsc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::thread;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let (tx, rx) = mpsc::channel();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..3 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let tx_clone = tx.clone();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        thread::spawn(move || {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            tx_clone.send(format!(\"线程 {} 的消息\", i)).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    drop(tx);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for msg in rx {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"收到: {}\", msg);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;生产者 0&quot;] --&gt;|send| D[&quot;mpsc::channel&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;生产者 1&quot;] --&gt;|send| D&#10;    C[&quot;生产者 2&quot;] --&gt;|send| D&#10;    D --&gt;|recv| E[&quot;消费者&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"生产者 0\"] --&gt;|send| D[\"mpsc::channel\"]\n    B[\"生产者 1\"] --&gt;|send| D\n    C[\"生产者 2\"] --&gt;|send| D\n    D --&gt;|recv| E[\"消费者\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"通道类型对比\">通道类型对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>创建方式</th>\n<th>缓冲</th>\n<th>阻塞行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无界通道</td>\n<td><code>mpsc::channel()</code></td>\n<td>无限</td>\n<td>发送不阻塞，接收在空时阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有界通道</td>\n<td><code>mpsc::sync_channel(n)</code></td>\n<td>固定 n</td>\n<td>缓冲满时发送阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::sync::mpsc;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let (tx, rx) = mpsc::sync_channel(2);&#10;&#10;    tx.send(1).unwrap();&#10;    tx.send(2).unwrap();&#10;    // tx.send(3).unwrap(); // 阻塞：缓冲区已满&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, rx.recv().unwrap());&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, rx.recv().unwrap());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::mpsc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let (tx, rx) = mpsc::sync_channel(2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tx.send(1).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tx.send(2).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // tx.send(3).unwrap(); // 阻塞：缓冲区已满</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", rx.recv().unwrap());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", rx.recv().unwrap());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"crossbeam-增强通道\">Crossbeam：增强通道</h2><p><code>crossbeam-channel</code> 提供了比标准库更强大的通道功能：MPMC、select 宏、超时支持。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use crossbeam_channel::{bounded, select, tick};&#10;use std::time::Duration;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let (tx, rx) = bounded(10);&#10;    let ticker = tick(Duration::from_secs(1));&#10;&#10;    std::thread::spawn(move || {&#10;        for i in 0..5 {&#10;            tx.send(i).unwrap();&#10;            std::thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(300));&#10;        }&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    loop {&#10;        select! {&#10;            recv(rx) -&gt; msg =&gt; {&#10;                match msg {&#10;                    Ok(val) =&gt; println!(&quot;数据: {}&quot;, val),&#10;                    Err(_) =&gt; break,&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;            recv(ticker) -&gt; _ =&gt; println!(&quot;心跳&quot;),&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use crossbeam_channel::{bounded, select, tick};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::time::Duration;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let (tx, rx) = bounded(10);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let ticker = tick(Duration::from_secs(1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    std::thread::spawn(move || {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for i in 0..5 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            tx.send(i).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            std::thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(300));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        select! {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            recv(rx) -> msg => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                match msg {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    Ok(val) => println!(\"数据: {}\", val),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    Err(_) => break,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            recv(ticker) -> _ => println!(\"心跳\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"scoped-thread\">Scoped Thread</h2><p><code>crossbeam::scope</code> 或 <code>std::thread::scope</code>（Rust 1.63+）允许线程借用栈上数据，无需 <code>move</code> 或 <code>Arc</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn main() {&#10;    let mut data = vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5];&#10;&#10;    std::thread::scope(|s| {&#10;        s.spawn(|| {&#10;            println!(&quot;子线程读取: {:?}&quot;, &amp;data);&#10;        });&#10;&#10;        s.spawn(|| {&#10;            println!(&quot;另一个子线程读取: {:?}&quot;, &amp;data);&#10;        });&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    data.push(6);&#10;    println!(&quot;主线程修改后: {:?}&quot;, data);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut data = vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    std::thread::scope(|s| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        s.spawn(|| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"子线程读取: {:?}\", &#x26;data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        s.spawn(|| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"另一个子线程读取: {:?}\", &#x26;data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data.push(6);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"主线程修改后: {:?}\", data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"线程与通道最佳实践\">线程与通道最佳实践</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实践</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>优先使用通道而非共享内存</td>\n<td>遵循 Go 的格言：&quot;不要通过共享内存来通信，而要通过通信来共享内存&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 scoped thread 避免不必要的克隆</td>\n<td>Rust 1.63+ 原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有界通道实现背压</td>\n<td>防止生产者速度远超消费者导致内存暴涨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记得 drop 发送端</td>\n<td>消费者的 <code>for msg in rx</code> 循环依赖发送端全部 drop 才会结束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 <code>crossbeam</code> 处理复杂场景</td>\n<td>select、MPMC、超时等高级需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>Send</code>/<code>Sync</code> 由编译器自动推导，在编译期排除数据竞争，无需运行时检查。</li>\n<li><code>thread::spawn</code> 的闭包必须满足 <code>Send + &#39;static</code>；跨线程传数据需用 <code>move</code> 转移所有权。</li>\n<li><code>mpsc</code> 通道通过消息传递转移所有权，多生产者只需 <code>clone</code> 发送端，消费端 <code>for msg in rx</code> 依赖全部发送端 drop 才结束。</li>\n<li>有界通道（<code>sync_channel</code>）通过阻塞发送实现背压，防止生产者淹没消费者。</li>\n<li><code>thread::scope</code> 允许线程借用栈上数据，避免不必要的 <code>Arc</code> 与克隆。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"线程与消息传递","id":"线程与消息传递"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"创建线程","id":"创建线程"},{"level":2,"text":"move 闭包与所有权转移","id":"move-闭包与所有权转移"},{"level":2,"text":"Send 与 Sync Trait","id":"send-与-sync-trait"},{"level":2,"text":"mpsc 通道","id":"mpsc-通道"},{"level":3,"text":"多生产者","id":"多生产者"},{"level":2,"text":"通道类型对比","id":"通道类型对比"},{"level":2,"text":"Crossbeam：增强通道","id":"crossbeam-增强通道"},{"level":2,"text":"Scoped Thread","id":"scoped-thread"},{"level":2,"text":"线程与通道最佳实践","id":"线程与通道最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型状态模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/type-system/typestate-pattern"},"next":{"title":"共享状态与 Mutex","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/concurrency/shared-state"}}